&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;43&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Collaborate with quantitative and risk teams to define product parameters, pricing models, and risk frameworks for new structured offerings.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
