descriptions.job-1wo6rcj:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Ripple, we’re building a world where value moves like information does today. It’s big, it’s bold, and we’re already doing it. Through our crypto solutions for financial institutions, businesses, governments and developers, we are improving the global financial system and creating greater economic fairness and opportunity for more people, in more places around the world. And we get to do the best work of our career and grow our skills surrounded by colleagues who have our backs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a highly motivated and experienced Senior Sales Manager to join our North America team. If you are passionate about bridging the gap between traditional finance (TradFi) and decentralized finance (DeFi) by building infrastructure to tokenize, store, and settle value in a simple, secure, and compliant way, come join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Sales Manager, you will work across all customer segments, ranging from the world&#39;s largest financial institutions to crypto-forward companies. You will lead customer conversations covering Ripple&#39;s digital asset custody, payments, OTC, trading, and stablecoin solutions, with a particular focus on digital asset custody, including platform security, governance, and operational controls.&amp;nbsp; This includes advising customers on deployment models involving Key Management Systems (HSMs and MPC), permissioning frameworks, and features related to entitlements, policies, and governance controls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and build commercial relationships with Ripple customers seeking digital asset solutions, including custody, payments, stablecoins, tokenization, and trading services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior institutional sales leaders to drive strategic opportunities across banks, custodians, broker-dealers, payment providers, asset managers, and other financial institutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead discovery, qualification, solution positioning, pricing discussions, and commercial negotiations for select accounts, driving opportunities from initial engagement through contract execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the sales process with functional and technical deep dives, working closely with Customer Solutions Directors and product specialists to address customer requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and coordinate the RFx process, including competitive analysis, storyline development, response drafting, answer refinement, and review cycles with internal and external subject matter experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate pricing and commercial inputs across sales, finance, product, legal, and commercial stakeholders to develop competitive and scalable customer proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pressure-test commercial strategies, proposals, and RFx responses to ensure alignment with customer objectives, product capabilities, and Ripple&#39;s business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally to develop deal strategies, account plans, and executive engagement models that advance opportunities toward successful closure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate deal records, including customer requirements, pricing assumptions, risks, blockers, competitive intelligence, and next-step action plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist the North American sales team in achieving quarterly and annual revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the voice of the customer and collaborate with product, marketing, and customer success teams to influence product roadmap priorities and drive new use cases for custody and other Ripple solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze client requirements and align them with product capabilities to develop compelling business cases and solution recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct market research on digital asset custody, tokenization, stablecoins, and broader digital asset infrastructure trends to establish yourself as a trusted advisor to customers and prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of distributed ledger technology and digital asset use cases, including smart contracts, decentralized finance, and other applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferably, a solid understanding of the digital asset custody market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong network with excellent relationships with large financial institutions, asset managers, and crypto natives who require digital asset custody solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in Sales/Business Development, Software/IT Systems product management, Technical Sales, Solution Architecture, or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of relevant experience advising and selling to financial institutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of successful sales or business development support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively with team members, take on responsibility, and work independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel as required by client and company engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;For positions that will be based in NY, the annual salary range for this position is below. Actual salaries may vary based on numerous factors including, among other things, an individual applicant’s experience and qualifications for the position. This range does not include equity or additional compensation, such as bonuses or commissions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;NY Annual Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$140,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$165,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Do Your Best Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The opportunity to build in a fast-paced start-up environment with experienced industry leaders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A learning environment where you can dive deep into the latest technologies and make an impact.&amp;nbsp; A professional development budget to support other modes of learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Thrive in an environment where no matter what race, ethnicity, gender, origin, or culture they identify with, every employee is a respected, valued, and empowered part of the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In-office collaboration for moments that matter is important to our culture, and we give managers and teams the flexibility to decide which 10+ days a month they come in.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bi-weekly all-company meeting - business updates and ask me anything style discussion with our Leadership Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We come together for moments that matter which include team offsites, team bonding activities, happy hours and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Control of Your Finances&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, bonuses, and equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive benefits that cover physical and mental healthcare, retirement, family forming, and family support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Employee giving match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mobile phone stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Care of Yourself&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;R&amp;amp;R days so you can rest and recharge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous wellness reimbursement and weekly onsite &amp;amp; virtual programming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous vacation policy - work with your manager to take time off when you need it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Industry-leading parental leave policies. Family planning benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Catered lunches, fully-stocked kitchens with premium snacks/beverages, and plenty of fun events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Benefits listed above are for full-time employees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ripple is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We’re committed to building a diverse and inclusive team. We do not discriminate against qualified employees or applicants because of race, color, religion, gender identity, sex, sexual identity, pregnancy, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, age, marital status, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, military status, or any other characteristic protected by local law or ordinance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please find our &lt;a href=&quot;https://ripple.com/legal/eu-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;UK/EU Applicant Privacy Notice &lt;/a&gt;and our &lt;a href=&quot;https://ripple.com/legal/ca-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;California Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for reference.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-1o4e3lf:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;T8fHdt86poiHHDxx8JFuaZ42s1e&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusrxAPLBMj4HaNZ2Hk0cu9Dh&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ILKqdtMeporUzGx2LJQuVO3DsRd&quot;&gt;The Senior Executive Officer (SEO) is responsible for the overall leadership, management, and performance of the ADGM regulated entity. The role is accountable for the execution of the firm&#39;s strategy, governance, regulatory compliance, risk management, and operational effectiveness, while serving as the primary point of contact with the Financial Services Regulatory Authority (FSRA).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxus2BXV0Inec96uUDFAtN13cg&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Htk2d2m2goCw4fxx8x9u9vaWsFe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Provide overall leadership and direction for the regulated entity, ensuring the successful execution of its strategic, operational, and commercial objectives.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UiFndJ3WYoi6d9xWfbzuU41vsOc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Hold ultimate responsibility for the day-to-day management, supervision, and control of the firm&#39;s regulated activities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CYuVdoaBDoG3DixE2sDuhyWhsJf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ensure the firm maintains compliance with all applicable regulatory requirements, licensing obligations, and governance standards.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IudZdpS73oYkUgx9j6VuQBSUsTc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Establish and foster a strong culture of compliance, risk management, accountability, and ethical conduct across the organisation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KEfsdWIlkoUMIoxkAa4utr9qseh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead and oversee senior management, ensuring effective execution, clear accountability, and strong organisational performance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LE37d4q8joZ341xQZG4u7J8usJh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ensure appropriate governance frameworks, policies, systems, and controls are implemented and operating effectively.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AlTddNeHIowISpxxQfmubW9OsWf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Oversee the identification and management of key regulatory, operational, financial, technology, and reputational risks, while ensuring the firm maintains adequate resources to support its business objectives and regulatory obligations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SEf1dHlCnoTPavxaATsuEX57sbg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Act as the primary liaison with the FSRA and lead all significant regulatory engagements, supervisory interactions, and licensing matters.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QrPjd1QmLoQVWixFFujuVGmFsXf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Maintain effective relationships with regulators, Board members, shareholders, and other key stakeholders, while providing regular updates on business performance, strategy, governance, regulatory matters, and key risks.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusARIj72olr3eTXM36O9YG7e&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QitxdDHrmoA7H7xHihaukGausbh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business, Finance, Economics, Law, Accounting, Risk Management, or a related discipline.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JJWGdoMmAogCcGxPBEuuXOAJsXd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Minimum 10 years of leadership experience within financial services, capital markets, fintech, digital assets, exchanges, broker dealers, custodians, clearing houses, payment firms, or other regulated financial institutions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WgOAdWR7Low7nWxWT6muEA3Bsec&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proven experience leading regulated businesses and managing senior stakeholders, including regulators and Boards.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EUGLdWxR7oSl5MxS1XguSMvusQe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong understanding of financial services regulation, governance, risk management, and regulatory expectations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DgwAdAPLMoBNpLxJScpu51KLsoU&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience overseeing business, operational, and control functions within a regulated environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I2rHdCHtLoxLXJxEwhjuBiBwsTb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;UAE and/or ADGM regulatory experience is strongly preferred.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SRtKdWamQobCJXxJinauQ18Xswh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability to satisfy the FSRA&#39;s Fit and Proper requirements and obtain approval as the Senior Executive Officer.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusM55X3fETrl52zBvHpCpqfh&quot;&gt;Profile&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KqdLdgWX3ouhy7xQyRZuyjEus2g&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strategic and commercially minded leader with strong business acumen.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NGcKdw5RioJpaBxoTrjuBguIsQd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Demonstrates integrity, sound judgement, accountability, and strong leadership capabilities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C249drqqboqHH8xe5YYu66F1seg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Able to balance growth objectives with effective governance and regulatory compliance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CncUd68wHoUc3vxmTFuumEKWscb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Comfortable operating in a fast-paced and evolving financial services environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I2EAdM3ftokIE6xiCMvuqeWZsag&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Passion for financial services, virtual assets industry, and emerging technologies.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UpGadb3VqoFNSQxwkpiucilnsyc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Comfortable leveraging technology and AI tools to enhance operational effectiveness and decision making.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Bybit, we are committed to fostering a supportive and enriching work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;br&gt;- Study Growth Fund: We support your professional development and continuous learning.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Events: Participate in regular team-building activities, workshops, and events designed to promote collaboration and innovation.&lt;br&gt;- Global Collaboration: Be part of a diverse, international team, working alongside colleagues from around the world.&lt;br&gt;- Career Advancement: Access opportunities for growth and advancement within a rapidly expanding global company.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Mobility: Grow with us- Your long-term development is important to us. We offer internal job opportunities to help build your career path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-15kmr8z:
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;ZU0GdNgvPoqwDaxYk5Il6PHXg5b&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgFH9OtDi8u8PvJkp2X8pzld&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgcshnBWrgiqwwExm248CIVh&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgN8zLxussPqnhqjRPlJwBYd&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgMsYVVUxqrq8vMGWy3vW4cd&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgFFaNkDgui9Tgmu9wp2MSRb&quot;&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgu9YbA2BuGAsFsAd2DLANOw&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-doxlg1QW6d7OqWIidmdMRW3xhhe&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JdbidBrjbo2RhixT7itlyPUOgGg&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Growth BI Project Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our CEO Office. This is a high-impact, end-to-end role that sits at the intersection of data intelligence and execution — covering OKX&#39;s key regulated markets globally. &lt;strong&gt;You will own the full loop:&lt;/strong&gt; identifying growth problems through data, diagnosing root causes, shaping recommendations, and driving outcomes through cross-functional execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IiNRdEmquoFBVcxiMPzlRQkpgCg&quot;&gt;Beyond technical and operational skills, what will set you apart is who you are. We are looking for someone with an exceptional ability to learn fast and operate in unfamiliar territory without losing direction. Someone who does not wait to be told what matters — you find it yourself. Someone who genuinely cares about the work and brings energy to problems that others find too messy or too ambiguous to touch.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgL1ggw4AAZMeTsBDSZTPjhg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgpWGz75t8MrfCDFxpQhezsd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Analytics &amp;amp; Insight&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg9xlcKWGh1YJ4wDCZ2NW1dh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Monitor core growth metrics across regulated markets, proactively identifying anomalies, trends, and emerging opportunities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgiIWhU5oIEANdpHuHuXlnmc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Conduct structured root-cause analysis on growth performance — moving beyond data description to diagnosis: why did this happen, and what should we do about it.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgGHRTU3bcrEoJw8YQoHSktb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Translate analytical findings into clear, prioritized recommendations for senior leadership and local market growth teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgPcfXT9syjFw0y5kV9o7wyc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build and maintain analytical frameworks and dashboards that give leadership a clear, real-time view of market health and growth efficiency.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgqMtIxUiIanldm1eJ2AlqPf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Management &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgYmdNwQzMmdSwcm2KVNKAfe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own the end-to-end execution of key growth initiatives: from scoping and planning through to delivery and outcome tracking.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg3C4gVg3McVVWCx84QF76ee&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive cross-functional coordination across growth, product, engineering, and operations teams — ensuring alignment, accountability, and on-time delivery.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgo18dskkDgRcSJ34gtMwUFd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Define measurable success criteria for each initiative and close the loop on results.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgbzdwZCIrqrV8craysw1HJS&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Augmented Ways of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgKNph2zPApys0547h7zc3Ng&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Actively apply AI tools and automation to accelerate analysis, reporting cycles, and operational workflows.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgLfsVzk7vGYgFjVifjUyLQc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Champion AI-native practices within the team and demonstrate productivity gains through concrete examples.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgkmeyjFfTrNPoYcWM2V4tpg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FNT7dlaWboPNAbx4SyglCPePgsc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At least 4 years of experience in growth analytics, business intelligence, strategy, or program management — ideally from a top internet company, fintech, Web3 firm, or management consulting background.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tp7IdGJbVo9ijAxI8MRlrYh0g4f&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Exceptional learning agility — able to rapidly absorb new domains, connect the dots across unfamiliar data, and develop informed views in areas where you had no prior expertise.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JAkQdspWnoc8mLxu6t7lc1Sbgzg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong logical and quantitative thinking — you break complex problems into structured components and form conclusions grounded in evidence, not assumption.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GZFtdV6ZQomZOtx9g5tlqxJagLh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Extreme self-motivation and ownership — you take full accountability for your workstreams, set your own direction, and are not satisfied until you see measurable outcomes. A genuine drive and passion for the work — you thrive in ambiguous, fast-moving environments, and find clarity and momentum where others find friction.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E3YpdAPZboOCvCxPTpSlWKNpgGb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Excellent communication skills; able to adapt between technical and non-technical audiences, and comfortable presenting to senior leadership.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WrUgdB8azoWvnAxD6SPlT9W4g3e&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Bilingual proficiency in English and Mandarin Chinese is preferred to work with stakeholders in Mandarin-speaking markets.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg1TFCIR5gT0jSKEqKk0k42c&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgH6kVTaY58BCJ4OfF0bgt1f&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lj2LdnWNRoKUDKx2KRUlg4eYgrb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Prior experience in the Web3 or crypto industry, or as a user of crypto products — genuine familiarity with the space is a meaningful advantage.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgkPebHDrdNfDjUkNyNSyKtb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Hands-on experience building AI agent systems or complex workflows, beyond general tool usage.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgpQbCNoMAwvE04GtLRkJchd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience working within international or multinational organizations, with cross-regional stakeholder exposure.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgByO2esoO8y7J09j8kk9Dad&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Solid track record in growth analytics or channel analysis — comfortable working with acquisition, retention, and channel performance data, and experience translating analytical work into growth decisions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg7O7DpgaCjSZHTfRntWmwif&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgg7GhFGeHi6Iin0R6hDNNNg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgYuK5mfs13XXJvo5j8uur6c&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Competitive total compensation package&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgCTHBZK6I0w4Em3dsnBVE0d&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
